Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:04.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（确定删除文件吗）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.37,0:01:06.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（文件删除中）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:30.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（Oscorp工业基因实验室）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:36.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（访问被拒绝 用户ID失效 文件暂停访问）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.01,0:01:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们因为我的所作所为而称我为怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will say I'm a monster for what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:01:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总以为我还有很多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought that I'd have more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.78,0:02:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他睡觉的时候喜欢开着灯 - 玛丽 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He likes to sleep with the lights on. - Mary, we have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.86,0:02:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.02,0:02:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.99,0:02:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一个安全的地方过夜 在日内瓦湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have found a safe place for us to spend the night, at Lake Geneva.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:02:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在上传吗 - 传到「罗斯福」上 全都传了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you uploading it? - To Roosevelt. All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.74,0:02:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in case we…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.85,0:03:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be fine, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到他的表情了吗 他永远也不会理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see his face? He ​​is never gonna understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽 这事我们已经讨论过了 我们没法回到原本的生活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary we've been through this. Our life as we know it is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.42,0:03:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今天起我们每天都要提心吊胆地生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will spend every day from now on looking over our shoulders…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.37,0:03:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不会感到安全 我们不能让他也这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never feeling safe. We can't do that to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他只是个小男孩 - 我知道 会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's just a little boy. - I know. It's going to be ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.73,0:03:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一刻都无法停歇啊 - 恐怕是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No rest for the weary hah. - No, I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所谓的职业危害吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occupational hazard I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在忙些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you're working on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.24,0:03:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,提前做些计划 你觉得我能跟机长谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just planning ahead. Do you think I could speak to the pilot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么 也许我能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something you need? Perhaps I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想提前联系一下地面人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd just like to radio ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.32,0:04:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,确保我们到达后一切都安排好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make sure everything's in order for when we land.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.09,0:04:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都知道这是不可能的 帕克博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think We both know that's not an option, Dr. Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.77,0:04:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.85,0:04:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们说你是个天才 - 理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They say you're a genius. - Richard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是认为你能逃掉的话就不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if you thought you could escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.00,0:04:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.79,0:05:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.27,0:05:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我呢 你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你没事的 好了 呼吸 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to make you safe. It's done.It's Done.Breathe.Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「罗斯福」 - 什么 - 「罗斯福」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roosevelt. - What? - Roosevelt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.26,0:05:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,重连上了 重连上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's back on. It's back on. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们会没事的 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey hey. We'll be alright. Okay? Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天又会发生什么事呢 纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got for me today, New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约一号频道现场播报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reporting live from the New York One chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.52,0:07:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oscorp工业一辆载有钚的卡车被劫持\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Oscorp truck carrying plutonium has been hijacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方已经开始追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Police chase is in progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们开工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟阿列克谢·西斯艾维奇打个招呼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say hello to Aleksei Sytsevich.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蜘蛛侠 - 你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spider-Man. - Hello, pedestrians.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock. Knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.51,0:08:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪犯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.47,0:08:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我的名字叫蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. My name is SpiderMan,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以叫我网格头 也可以叫我超凡小虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can call me web head, you can call me amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就是别大半夜叫我吃饭 懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't call me late for dinner. You get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.56,0:09:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喜欢握手 难道喜欢拥抱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a handshake? Are you a hugger?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.10,0:09:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可是杀人犯！- 好吧 随你便咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a killer. - Who! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 钚-238是放射性物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}WARNING. Plutonium-238 is a radioactive material.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且易爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and is highly explosive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过一下 别挤着我好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. There's room for all of us on the sidewalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抱着图纸呢 帮个忙好吗 有人帮个忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please I've got blueprints here. A little help, a little help, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:28.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的枪出了什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're having problems with your gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我帮帮你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me help you out with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 有车辆通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, coming through.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是我的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.51,0:09:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好 我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bad. I'm gonna be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没事了 你怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. There you go. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.06,0:09:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧 - 你是蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You alright. - You're Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.00,0:09:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,从衣服上看出来的哈 这些很重要 迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Costume gives the way hah? Look, these looks pretty important, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:09:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道我的名字 - 你的胸章上面写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know my name? - Its written on your badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是个无名小卒 - 嘿 你不是 你是个重要人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a nobody. - Hey! You're not a nobody, you're a somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,舔一下 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lick that. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.25,0:10:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我需要你 你就是我在这儿的眼睛和耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need you. You're my eyes and ears out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.23,0:10:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗 - 好的 - 回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alright! - Alright. - See you out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 违规操作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning: Violation of protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:10:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住了 抓住了 还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha, gotcha. No. I got you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.10,0:11:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 还有你 你哪也跑不了 过来 上爸爸这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey you you.No, you're not going anywhere. Come here, come to daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.72,0:11:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,都闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it. Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.04,0:11:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 别闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.68,0:11:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等下 快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey wait. Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.24,0:11:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 抱歉 我要迟到一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm sorry. I'm running a bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我堵车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got stuck in some traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还真会挑时间 已经开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your timing is terrible. It's started already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.06,0:11:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 对不起 - 你到哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. I'm sorry. - Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.63,0:11:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,百老汇大街 一街 二街 三街了\N{\fnArial\fs30}First in Broadway. Second in Broadway. Third in Broadway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,五分钟就到 最多十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes, ten tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到的是警笛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those sirens?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peter - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彼得 - 不是警笛呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peter. - No sirens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, what is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:11:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.77,0:12:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来向大家介绍位非常优秀的女士 - 我保证马上就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now I'd like to introduce an extraordinary young lady. - I'll be right there. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请今年的毕业生代表 格温·斯黛西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This year's valedictorian. Please welcome, Gwen Stacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 尊敬的各位教职员工 毕业生及其家人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, esteemed faculty and families of my fellow graduates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常荣幸站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor to be standing up here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.09,0:12:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我跟你说啊 我赶时间呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello… I told you, I am running a bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.67,0:12:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你完蛋啦小蜘蛛 哈哈哈哈 - 是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I saw the Spider. Hahahaha. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.90,0:12:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都认为自己拥有无限光阴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that we all think we're immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很理所当然的想法 虽然我们毕业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to feel that way, We're graduating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.00,0:12:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就像这短暂的高中生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}But like our brief four years in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命的可贵便在于她无法永垂不朽\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes life valuable is that it doesn't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.27,0:13:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为有限 所以珍贵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes it precious is that it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在的我们最深有体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that now more than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I say it…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在今天说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}today of all days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了提醒我们 时光易逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}to remind us that time is luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把它浪费在无关紧要的事上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't waste it living someone else's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,着眼自身 让你的人生变得有意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yours count for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 为你心中的最重要的事而奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight for what matters to you, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.89,0:13:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样即使我们无法永生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if we fall short,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.02,0:13:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也没有辜负这段光阴\N{\fnArial\fs30}what better way is there to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿走啦 这不属于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that. That's not yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之间还没完 小蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not ends, Spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.99,0:14:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我认识那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I know that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.41,0:14:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.54,0:14:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 再来一次 再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, do that again, do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.34,0:14:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点就要去偷长袍和帽子替你上台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost stole a cap and gown and run up there myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.61,0:14:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想看看那场面 别照了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to have seen that.That would have been pretty awesome. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.72,0:14:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 这是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.45,0:15:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真为你感到骄傲 孩子 我真为你感到自豪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so proud of you. Sweetheart, I'm so proud of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.84,0:15:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你本叔叔最先会说什么 - 我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know the first thing Uncle Ben would say. - I know, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.49,0:15:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你得抓紧了 派对已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You got to hurry up the party's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.02,0:15:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 你要步入社会找份工作了「\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - You gotta go out and get a job."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但他接下来会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, the second thing he would say:
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不要随波逐流 要找到自己的路」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't just follow the path. Make your own trail."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.17,0:15:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱默生说的 - 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ralph Waldo Emerson. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么说不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean no?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.46,0:15:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,本说是他原创的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben told me he'd made it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的在这里学到了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really did learn something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.18,0:15:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你叔叔能在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish your uncle could have been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我也是 还有我父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeh me too. And my folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.53,0:15:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeh, yeh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.03,0:15:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你可以走了 快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, you could go. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.11,0:15:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快来 一起照一张 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, get together, get together right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.48,0:15:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 格温 茄子 - 茄子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quick Gwen. Alright. Cheese. - Cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.41,0:15:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我两秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeh.Just gimme two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.09,0:15:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别走太远 - 很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't go too far away. - Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.85,0:16:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你的堵车不会碰巧和这群俄罗斯人劫匪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your traffic jam have anything to do with the Russian mob.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.11,0:16:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这些机枪有关吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And machine guns, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you just tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.25,0:16:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就要演讲了我怎么能跟你说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what am I gonna do? You were about to give a speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.33,0:16:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格温 亲爱的 家庭合照 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gwen. Honey, family photos. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你来家庭聚餐吗 - 想不让我来都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, you coming to Dim Sum? - You can't keep me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚上八点 别迟到了 - 现在就饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's at eight o'clock. Don't be late. - I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.78,0:16:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.32,0:16:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再给你演讲一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna do my speech to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,整晚 我愿意一整晚都听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All night. I want to hear it all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一遍又一遍 整个晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over and over again, all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.02,0:16:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 一起来吧 快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, join us? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.74,0:16:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要去找我伯母了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find my aunt, I gotta find my aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.74,0:16:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我过会儿回来找你们 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna catch up later. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将会树敌 会有人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna make enemies. People will get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.89,0:16:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你向我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I want you to promise me something, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:17:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要把格温卷进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave Gwen out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.83,0:17:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.92,0:17:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter's outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.45,0:17:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong? Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.12,0:17:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我父亲 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my father, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.46,0:17:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我走到哪都能看见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I see him everywhere I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.95,0:17:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办 他在我脑中挥之不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to do. I can't get him out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.62,0:17:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我们之前都讨论清楚了 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, but we'd talked about this. - Yeah, I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是他能决定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not his choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.26,0:18:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应他 我会和你保持距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promised him that I would keep away from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.12,0:18:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我现在却要来和你的家人吃晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now I'm gonnna come and eat dinner with your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么能这么做 我成什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I do this? What does this make me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.97,0:18:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这样做让你成了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know I don't know what does that make you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让我无法原谅我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes me not able to live with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为这意味着你爱我 - 我是爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought that it would make you love me? - I do love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.51,0:18:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这还不够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why isn't that enough? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.94,0:18:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what if something happens to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.28,0:18:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他一样 因为我的关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like it happened to him, because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait wait wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让这种事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你是蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, you are Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.23,0:18:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.03,0:18:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我更爱彼得·帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I love Peter Parker more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.53,0:18:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说 这很值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's worth it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:18:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能连你也失去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot lose you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不能失去我 所以我们不能在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you can't lose me, we can't be together?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做对谁有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who does that work out for, Peter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.54,0:19:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 我很抱歉 格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. I'm sorry, Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.06,0:19:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一次又一次这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have done this to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, again… Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.01,0:19:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我承受不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't live like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I break up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.59,0:19:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我要跟你分手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.69,0:20:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, New Yorkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,又迎来了美好的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for another beautiful day here in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们越来越多地在城市中见到蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The city increases in sightings of Spider-Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,引发了全国关于警察在美国打击犯罪中作用的讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spark a national debate over the role of vigilantes in American crime fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于蜘蛛侠 他昨晚又在曼哈顿桥拯救了数十人的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that Spider-Man? Last night on Manhatten Bridge he saved a dozen lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎致电与我们共同讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to hear your calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得没有蜘蛛侠这座城市就没有了希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think without Spider-Man there is no hope for this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.49,0:20:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为是谁在为他造成的破坏买单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think pays the bill for all the damages he causes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.67,0:20:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你我这些纳税人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you and me the taxpayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:44.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你做的吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you make this? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.15,0:20:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是风力涡轮机 你做的 开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a wind turbine. You made this? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.98,0:20:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直巧夺天工\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.89,0:20:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟没坏一样 对吧 我陪你走回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good as new, right? I'll walk you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么名字 - 豪尔赫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your name? - Jorge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:21:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪尔赫你好 我叫蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jorge, I'm Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.79,0:21:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在外面晃荡 我担心孩子们的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel like my kids are safe with him out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.73,0:21:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,少管闲事 让警察做他们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}get out of the way and let the police do their job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人认为蜘蛛侠不止一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some folks think that there might be more than one Spider-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.64,0:21:14.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么看 他是独行侠还是一个团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, one guy or many?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真想见见面具后面那张脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd love to know who's behind that mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.85,0:21:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 扮得不错 - 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, nice outfit. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.49,0:21:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一位观众来电 他叫迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a caller on the line named Max,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.24,0:21:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,声称他认识蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}he said he knows Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.10,0:21:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很伤心 蜘蛛侠被误会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm upset…Spider-Man to me is being misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个大好人 一直在保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a very, very good person, He's protecting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.56,0:21:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅如此 他救过我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not only that, he saved my life onetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就成了好兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we sort of became best friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.47,0:21:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多少钱 - 你是那个蜘蛛男\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much? - You're that Spider guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜘蛛虾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Spider-Bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.30,0:21:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是蜘蛛虾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Spider-Bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.44,0:21:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个蜘蛛侠 他不是警察 也不是消防员\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Spider-Man guy, he's not the police, he's not a fireman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他是凭什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What gives him the right,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.70,0:21:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,管别人的闲事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get involved in other people's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.42,0:22:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 亲爱的 我能进来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, honey, can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.80,0:22:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.75,0:22:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 期末考试九点就开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, the final starts at nine, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.42,0:22:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你说过 车老是坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you said you'd take my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.94,0:22:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把它送到修理厂 记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the shop b'coz it keeps dying, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.78,0:22:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等会儿 梅伯母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme a second, I'll be out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.82,0:22:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上去开门 很快就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get the door, just gimme a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.38,0:22:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我进去 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just let me in, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力把鞋给\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…trying to get…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.04,0:22:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 九点期末考 你还有空把车送修吗 - 好的 马上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The final is at 9, are you going to take my car to the shop? - YES. Just give me a…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呆在外面别进来 我什么都没穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't come in. Stay outside, I'm so naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.94,0:22:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, for goodness's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.85,0:22:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你会把车送去修理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you're gonna take my car into the shop because…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.92,0:22:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 好着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you alright? - Yeah. I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.54,0:23:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在 就是什么都没穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just…I'm very naked right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.68,0:23:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸怎么这么脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your face, it's filthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.33,0:23:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脏吗 - 脏死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我刚才清理完烟囱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah, yeah, I was cleaning the chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.73,0:23:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 咱家没烟囱 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have no chimney. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.70,0:23:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要迟到了 - 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're late. - I know, I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.41,0:23:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下楼 - 我还不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Downstairs… - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上 - 你能先离开一下么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now! - Can you…can you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.83,0:23:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 我走 - 我什么都没穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alright, I'm leaving! - I'm naked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.29,0:23:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 我爱你 - 我也爱你 快起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning. I love you. - I love you too. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.01,0:24:03.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（迈克斯和蜘蛛侠携手拯救纽约城）
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.14,0:24:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧谁来了 小蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ho ho ho, look who's here? Spidey!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.91,0:24:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好吗 好极了 迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was your morning? Aces, Max, aces.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.00,0:24:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我忙着拯救世界 保护市民\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been out saving the world, protecting everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.91,0:24:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,猜猜今天谁过生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, isn't it somebody's birthday today?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.51,0:24:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来就是为了这个 你记得我的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you're here. You remembered my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.53,0:24:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你忙着打击犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the crime fighting you've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.84,0:24:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是抽空来看望卑微的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all of a sudden you take time to visit little old me, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.30,0:24:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.75,0:24:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过当然了 你怎么会不来看我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…of course you would, why won't you visit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.80,0:24:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可是好兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.70,0:24:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也太贴心了吧 给我烤了个蛋糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? You made me a cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.34,0:24:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真该让别人看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't get the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.41,0:24:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对民众是多么贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see these all kind things you do for people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道媒体是怎么说你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what they say about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.89,0:24:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}you in the press but it doesn't matter to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.24,0:24:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我认识真实的你 超凡的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I know the real you, because you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.35,0:25:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 媒体就缺这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, that's what the press needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.48,0:25:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们应该叫你超凡蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should call you "The Amazing Spider-Man."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.95,0:25:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗 小蜘蛛 我很喜欢 迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that, Spidey? I like it a lot, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.76,0:25:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天一定会是个超凡的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good…because today is going to be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.13,0:25:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,39号电路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Circuit thirty nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.72,0:25:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没迟到 哈维 给我15分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not late, Harvey, I'll be there in fifteen minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.19,0:25:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想问问你能不能找个服务员代我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna know if you can find another waitress to replace me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.30,0:25:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我在医院的培训开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I start my training rounds at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.40,0:25:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mention this to Peter,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.69,0:25:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要是知道肯定会担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want him to know because he worries, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.52,0:25:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的好的 周四我做两份工 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, okay, you got it. Double shift on Thursday. Okay bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.09,0:25:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚才那是谁 - 哈维\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who was that? - Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.55,0:25:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 又是两份工吗 - 偶尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Another double shift, huh? - Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.72,0:25:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,闲着也是闲着 同事们也都挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing else to do, I like the girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.10,0:25:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想本了 还能挣点零花钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed Ben, gives me a little extra in the cookie jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.60,0:26:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我又卖了几张照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sold another, another.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.63,0:26:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖给号角日报 也能帮上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}couple of photos to the Bugle so that outa help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.07,0:26:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老板能付合理的薪酬才叫帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what really help if that guy would pay you a fair wage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.08,0:26:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说詹姆森吗 他会给我合理的薪酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jameson? Jameson would pay me some fair wages,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.35,0:26:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这是1961年 他会给我合理的薪酬\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it was 1961, he would pay me a fair wage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.39,0:26:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你干什么呢 干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Hey, wait. What are you doing? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.95,0:26:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要洗衣服啊 - 不 衣服我来洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm doing my laundry. - No, I do the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.50,0:26:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的活 从你6岁起\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my job, I've been doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.17,0:26:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的衣服就是我洗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}your laundry since you were six years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.68,0:26:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但我都要上大学了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand that, I'm in college now,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.45,0:26:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的内裤也该我自己洗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's time that I took care of my own dirty underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.28,0:26:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次你自己洗的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last time you did the laundry,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来的全成了蓝色或者红色\N{\fnArial\fs30}you turned everything blue and red.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.34,0:26:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是无心之过 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a mistake, cause' I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.88,0:26:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在洗美国国旗 你就让\N{\fnArial\fs30}washing…the…the American flag, my…can you just please…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.63,0:26:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会去洗国旗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one washes the flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.62,0:26:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会 以后不会了 这事别提了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do and I won't anymore, forget it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.49,0:26:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就让我自己 只是内裤而已 - 这是我的洗衣机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- fine, can I just do my…it's just underwear! - This is my machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.60,0:26:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我家 衣服我来洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my laundry, my home,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.07,0:26:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,洗衣机我来用 退后 吃你的早饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}my machine. Back off, eat your breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.69,0:26:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命 洗衣警长 我等会儿再洗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright laundry sheriff. I'll do it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.56,0:26:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来洗 - 算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll do it. - No, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.17,0:26:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给我吧 - 我再找时间自己洗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give it to me. - No, I'll do it some other time, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.63,0:26:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 - 白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.12,0:26:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.81,0:27:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要堵死了 快点快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of jam. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.63,0:27:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着点 伙计 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch it, buddy. - Hey, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.58,0:27:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oscorp工业有幸宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oscorp Industries is proud to announce…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.04,0:27:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,已架设好世界上首个电磁输电网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world's first electromagnetic power grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.96,0:27:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过将老旧的发电厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}by converting aging power stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.80,0:27:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,改建为新的水力发电塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}into a field of hydro electric towers…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.46,0:27:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们生产绿色可持续的洁净能源\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're generating clean, green, sustainable energy…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.45,0:27:32.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,满足曼哈顿 乃至全世界的能源需求\N{\fnArial\fs30}to power Manhatten… and finally the rest of the world…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.38,0:27:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 狄龙 你迟到了 - 双层列车太慢了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dillon, you're late. - Double Decker trains were so slow, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.81,0:27:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道不知道Oscorp现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you realise that Oscorp is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.18,0:27:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,负责整个城市的能源供应吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}now responsible for the entire city's energy supply?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.51,0:27:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 我提交了很多关于电网的设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I do. I submitted the designs for the power grid and they used a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.14,0:27:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我发现你们用的正是我的设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I noticed that in those power grids were designed by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.52,0:27:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你设计了电网 我还说我是蜘蛛侠呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You designed them? Sure you did and I'm Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.22,0:27:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不是蜘蛛侠 他是狮子座而你是人马座\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're no Spider-Man. He's a Leo you're a Sagittarius!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.69,0:27:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再敢提起他试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever speak about him again,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.61,0:27:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我不把你的脑袋拧下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna rip your flat-goon head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.02,0:28:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,干活去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.44,0:28:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问您要去几层 - 74层\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which floor please - 74.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.19,0:28:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.96,0:28:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙按一下电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hold that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.26,0:28:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别担心 - 谢谢 你真是个绅士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. - Thank you, you're a real gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.62,0:28:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分人都直接让门关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most people would just let that close.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.50,0:28:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分人不关心别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, most people don't notice other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.43,0:28:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问你要去几层 - 63层\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which floor please - 63.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.74,0:28:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别急 几层来着 - 呃 63层\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on. What's it? - Er…63.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.66,0:28:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 63层 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 63, please - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.73,0:28:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.39,0:28:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫迈克斯 迈克斯·狄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er…my name is Max, Max Dillon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.18,0:28:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫格温 很高兴认识你 - 很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Gwen. Nice to meet you. - Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.66,0:28:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是你生日吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it your birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.83,0:28:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 对 没错 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah, well, I…er,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.78,0:28:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们 在我房间留了这个传单\N{\fnArial\fs30}they…fortunately leave this flyer in my room…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日派对 大场子 名人都会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}birthday party, big club… A lot of celebrities…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.40,0:28:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 我本可以邀请你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wow. - I would like to invite you,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.01,0:28:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是宾客名单已经定下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just that the guest list is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.36,0:28:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 还是谢谢你 听起来很热闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, got it, got it but thank you anyway. This's exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.67,0:29:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定很有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be cool, huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.44,0:29:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界都这么关注你\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have the whole world look at you like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.21,0:29:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠救了我一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Spider-Man saved my life one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.10,0:29:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,茫茫人海中他救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of all the people in the whole city, he saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.24,0:29:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.07,0:29:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一定很\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be really…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.33,0:29:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,63层到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Floor 63.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.38,0:29:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice to meet you, Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.84,0:29:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 她记得我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, she remembered my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.74,0:29:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.54,0:29:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面很暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dark in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.28,0:30:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的眼睛会适应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes will adjust.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.66,0:30:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是暗点好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.51,0:30:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.57,0:30:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没想到我会这样死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not how I imagined I'd die.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.20,0:30:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我的儿子 跟看陌生人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking at my son, seeing a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.65,0:30:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 你前途无量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had such potential, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.53,0:31:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明明智商超群 却把它拒之门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such fierce intelligence and yet you're throwing it all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.22,0:31:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把我拒之门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}You threw me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.04,0:31:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我11岁你就把我送到了寄宿学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kicked me off to boarding school when I was eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.00,0:31:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我16岁生日那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my 16th birthday…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.29,0:31:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就送了一瓶威士忌 又或者是你助理送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you sent me scotch, or one of your assistants did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.64,0:31:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计是后者 因为卡上写着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure because the card read:
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.90,0:31:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请笑纳 诺曼·奥斯本敬上\N{\fnArial\fs30}With compliments, Norman Osborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.35,0:31:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不指望你的原谅 再也不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't expect forgiveness from you, any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.78,0:31:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着 我不相信奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know what? I don't believe in miracles.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.92,0:31:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又怎么会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you possibly understand…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.79,0:31:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的童年必须被牺牲掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your childhood had to be sacrificed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.65,0:31:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,来换取更重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}for something greater?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.49,0:31:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是为了我 还是为了你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just for me, for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.42,0:31:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手开始抽搐了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have your hands started to twitch yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.08,0:31:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你夜不能寐\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you lay awake…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.60,0:31:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,感受到它的侵袭\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you feel it coming…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.69,0:31:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏匿在皮肤之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding under the skin…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.34,0:32:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,随时准备显形\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting to show itself…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.96,0:32:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴露出你的本来面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}to show you who you really are…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.54,0:32:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,逆转录细胞增生症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retroviral Hyperplasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.21,0:32:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told you…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.17,0:32:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是遗传病\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's genetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.05,0:32:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,家族遗传\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.56,0:32:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯本家的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Osborn curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.84,0:32:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你这个年龄开始发作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it began at your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.16,0:32:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.16,0:32:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hand, give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.16,0:32:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留给你最重要的遗产\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest inheritance I can give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.58,0:32:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't merely money,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.29,0:32:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.22,0:32:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的毕生心血\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sum total of all my work,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.16,0:33:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为续命所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything I did to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.01,0:33:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你能完成我未竟的事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can succeed where I failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.91,0:33:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊敬的詹姆森 新的照片 发票已附\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dear Mr Jameson New pix and invoice enclosed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.02,0:33:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,您可以考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.26,0:33:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许蜘蛛侠是想帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}that maybe Spider-man is trying to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.08,0:33:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬上 彼得·帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sincerely, Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.11,0:33:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,新闻播报 诺曼·奥斯本先生 Osborn工业\N{\fnArial\fs30}News just in, Mr Norman Osborn, the legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.73,0:33:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的创建者和首席执行官刚刚去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}founder and CEO of Oscorp Industries has died.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.98,0:33:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯本的遗产确认\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Osborn estate has confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.95,0:33:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他的独子继承\N{\fnArial\fs30}he is survived by his only son,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.66,0:33:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利·奥斯本 他是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry Osborn, who is the sole heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.66,0:33:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oscorp商业帝国的唯一继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Oscorp corporate empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.38,0:33:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯本从根本上改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Osborn fundamentaly changed the.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.91,0:33:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,医疗业治疗疾病的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}medical profession's approach to human healing…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.78,0:33:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,影响了数以百万计的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and affected the lives of millions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.14,0:33:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建立Oscorp是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started Oscorp because I.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.02,0:33:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看看我身边的世界 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}looked at the world around me and I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.76,0:33:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以做得更好 我们应该做的更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We can do better. We should do better."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.68,0:34:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱因斯坦说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Einstein said the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.70,0:34:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有改变思维方式 世界才会因此改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}cannot be changed without changing our thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.14,0:34:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但改变不仅仅是一句口号\N{\fnArial\fs30}but change isn't just a slogan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.34,0:34:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,它始于勤恳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It begins with hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.87,0:34:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变是始于坚持和投入的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change begins with persistence and commitment.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.99,0:34:16.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯本先生改变了世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Osborn changed the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.46,0:34:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在是时候让我们每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now it's up to each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.82,0:34:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来延续他的希望和梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ensure that his hopes and dreams remain alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.26,0:34:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是从今天开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.23,0:34:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天是 - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Today… - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.12,0:34:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请问是格温·斯黛西吗 - 我是 请问您是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this Gwen Stacy? - Yes, it's, who's calling?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.62,0:34:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是牛津大学奖学金项目组\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm calling from the Oxford scholar program.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.82,0:34:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你一个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've some exciting news.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.29,0:34:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 狄龙 你得留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Dillon, you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.33,0:34:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在基因组实验室里有电力故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a current flow problem in genomics lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.01,0:34:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下去看看怎么回事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you stay and take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.27,0:34:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是我生日 大家都走了 为什么我得留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my birthday.Everybody else is leaving, why do I have to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.70,0:34:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为你与众不同 - 斯迈思 我是说斯迈思先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because you're special, - Smythe, I mean Mr Smythe…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.46,0:34:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.08,0:34:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物发电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bio electrogenesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.16,0:35:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是由有机生物体发电\N{\fnArial\fs30}The generation of electricity by living organisms…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.71,0:35:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.76,0:35:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们倒是在聚会\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least somebody's partying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.35,0:35:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是小毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a little sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.45,0:35:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能弄好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got your medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.92,0:35:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我为公司设计发明这么多 他们连我的生日都\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on my birthday. After all I've done for this company, designed and created.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.26,0:35:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.19,0:35:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 5A区异常 - 我知道 我猜你也不知道今天是我生日吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Error in sector 5A - I know, I bet you didn't know it was birthday, huh,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.36,0:35:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说呢 卡里\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.42,0:35:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能给我唱生日歌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you sing "Happy Birthday" For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.58,0:35:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是自己唱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just have to sing for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.44,0:35:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔伯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilbert!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.13,0:35:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁啊 - 我是迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.05,0:35:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把32区的总闸拉掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you shut down power in sector 32, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.48,0:35:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 我现在不在公司 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Forget it I'm out the door. - What do you mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.21,0:35:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经上来了 这里很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm up here, it's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.63,0:35:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 迈克斯 - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, Max. - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.35,0:35:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己去搞定 自己给自己唱生日歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it myself and I'll sing to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.12,0:35:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Birthday…to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.61,0:36:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我生日快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Birthday…dear Max…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝我生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Birthday…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.90,0:36:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.60,0:36:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,系统重装完毕 愿您今天过得愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}System restored. Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.15,0:36:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 Oscorp工业之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, Oscorp's has been under intense public.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.13,0:37:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因康纳斯博士的事 饱受公众质疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}scrutiny in the wake of Dr. Connors' recent breach of trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.50,0:37:02.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说 公众被惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, people are pisssed off because.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.81,0:37:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他想把全纽约的人变成巨型蜥蜴\N{\fnArial\fs30}he tried to turn everyone in N.Y city into giant lizards?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.11,0:37:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given that…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.88,0:37:11.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们叫停了所有有他参与的\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the animal hybrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.33,0:37:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,动物杂交项目\N{\fnArial\fs30}program he was involved in were destroyed…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.50,0:37:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,以重塑投资者的信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}to restore investor confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.23,0:37:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是奥斯本式的作风\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the Osborn way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.97,0:37:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,碍事的人就撇下 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever's inconvenient around here, just get rid of it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.94,0:37:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在大家的矛头可能会转向你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much of that scrutiny may fall on you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.95,0:37:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为合理的推诿是你最好的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We felt that plausible deniability was your best option.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.89,0:37:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, sure, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.22,0:37:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,把价值两千亿的公司留给一个二十岁的小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty-year-old kid. 200 billion dollar company.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.12,0:37:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这当爹的是怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was dad thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.10,0:37:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你们都是律师 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean you're all lawyers…right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.36,0:37:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会有人怀疑他是不是老糊涂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely someone must have questioned his sanity in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.60,0:37:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也肯定有人想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone must have thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.74,0:37:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在法律层面宣布他无判断能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}about having him declared legally incompetent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.15,0:37:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我们现在这场谈话就简单多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}would have made this conversation a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.39,0:37:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 叫我奥斯本先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Harry… - It's Mr. Osborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.60,0:37:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.07,0:38:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.50,0:38:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他的助手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were his assistant, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.50,0:38:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.26,0:38:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 费利西亚 - 你好 费利西亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Felicia. - Felicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.14,0:38:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今天开始 你们都归费利西亚管\N{\fnArial\fs30}From now on, everybody at this table will work for Felicia.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.34,0:38:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为她归我管\N{\fnArial\fs30}because Felicia works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.92,0:38:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁想说什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would anybody like to speak up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.51,0:38:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 这样你们就暂时保住了饭碗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well good then, you can all keep your job for a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.71,0:38:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 有位叫彼得·帕克的想见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir… There's a Peter Parker want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.24,0:38:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,费利西亚 你把这张单子里所有文件找给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felicia, I want to see every file on this list.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.30,0:38:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一份都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.51,0:39:10.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得·帕克 我简直不敢相信是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter Parker. It's like seeing a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.51,0:39:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.76,0:39:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Random.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.86,0:39:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有十年了吧 - 八年\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What ten years. - It's eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.44,0:39:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,也快十年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.60,0:39:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找我什么事 - 我看了新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up? - It's on the news, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.84,0:39:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说你父亲去世了 所以我过来想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard about your dad and I wanted to come and…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.94,0:39:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你 看看你过得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}see you, check it out, see how you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.72,0:39:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我刚刚正和一群人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…umm…I'm with some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.79,0:39:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the middle of a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.37,0:39:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不是有意打扰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I don't want to intrude,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.06,0:39:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是虽然过了很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it has been a long time and.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.13,0:39:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我多少理解你现在的处境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of know exactly what you're going through right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.19,0:39:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母去世的时候有你在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were so there for me when my parents…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.66,0:39:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.78,0:39:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.06,0:40:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you man.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.06,0:40:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.73,0:40:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲的事我深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.25,0:40:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把牙套摘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got your braces off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.70,0:40:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样你的一字眉就更加瞩目了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now there's nothing to distract from your unibrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.44,0:40:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.61,0:40:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.99,0:40:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在还是每天早上都吹头发吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you still blow drying your hair every morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.98,0:40:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个嘛 我有一个男仆会帮我举着吹风机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umm…you know…one of my man servants hold the hair dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.12,0:40:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是梳头我自己梳\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I work the comb.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.87,0:40:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 至少我还是能生活自理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so at least I'm not completely helpless.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.22,0:40:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕业以后我去了巴西和新加坡\N{\fnArial\fs30}After graduation I went to Brazil and Singapore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.48,0:40:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样 - 然后还有欧洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - And then Europe,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.99,0:40:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去了欧洲 - 我见过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you know, I went to Europe. - I saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.05,0:40:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么叫你见过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you saw me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.28,0:41:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过你在杂志上跟一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw you in some magazine with some.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.77,0:41:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,法国超模的照片 你知道是什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}French supermodel, you know what I'm talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.72,0:41:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, dude,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.21,0:41:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟模特在一起太伤神了 - 我懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that whole model thing is so exhausting. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.10,0:41:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.06,0:41:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有女朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.22,0:41:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 还真是问倒我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er…that's the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.97,0:41:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,问倒我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.70,0:41:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.27,0:41:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.50,0:41:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.52,0:41:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我解释不清楚 事情太复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.06,0:41:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不把事情复杂化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't do complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.70,0:41:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以她是谁啊 叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's her name? Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.01,0:41:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫格温 格温·斯黛西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her name is Gwen, Gwen Stacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.86,0:41:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格温·斯黛西 - 她是你手下的员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gwen Stacy? - She works for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.78,0:41:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 她是我的员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? She works for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.35,0:41:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那里算是半工半读吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Oscorp. She does work study at Oscorp.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.00,0:41:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是模范员工么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she a model employee?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.20,0:42:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 当年我父亲把我送走以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, when my father sent me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.26,0:42:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就尝试忘记这里的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to forget everything about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.69,0:42:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这其中也包括你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that kind of includes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.37,0:42:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用跟我解释的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to explain anything to me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.70,0:42:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩都是被抛弃的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both got dumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.45,0:42:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有试着去搞清你父母离开的原因吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever figure out why your parents bailed?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.32,0:42:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸遗物里有个公文包\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad left a briefcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.95,0:42:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩这个了 一公文包的垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thats all I got, a briefcase full of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.82,0:42:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了 我尽量不去想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever, I don't know. I try not to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.68,0:42:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这做法管用吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that working out for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.63,0:42:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,很管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.26,0:42:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好臂力啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, nice arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.44,0:42:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,手腕而已 关键是手腕技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the wrist. It's just all in the wrist, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.76,0:42:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好好锻炼也可以的 - 是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You could do it too, if you just strengthen up that. - Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.87,0:42:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必须承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to admit though,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.47,0:42:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里发生了许多怪事\N{\fnArial\fs30}things have gotten a little crazy around here man.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.50,0:43:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨型蜥蜴啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giant lizards, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.71,0:43:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛小子啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.74,0:43:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一个 一个叫蜘蛛侠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one guy, just one Spider-Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.73,0:43:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者蜘蛛女侠 我们也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}or woman. We don't know…for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.62,0:43:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,管他呢 他竟然穿着紧身衣爬到树上救猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever dude. He wears spandex to rescue kittens from trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.45,0:43:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是大开眼界\N{\fnArial\fs30}So impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.05,0:43:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是觉得他给了人们希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to think he gives people hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.83,0:43:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.35,0:43:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许最终所有事情都会好转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe eventually everything's gonna be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.40,0:43:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能等到那天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had time for eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.79,0:43:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.19,0:43:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克斯韦尔·狄龙 电力工程师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maxwell Dillon, electrical engineer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.81,0:43:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,无亲无故的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No associates or friends to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.14,0:43:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他提交的电网设计被我们化用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He submitted specs for the grid, that we…appropriated.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.85,0:43:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人毫无存在感\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy was…invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.47,0:43:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,华尔街都在怕哈利那个小屁孩接手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wall Street is nervous enough of that child, Harry, taking over.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.37,0:43:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得想法把他踢走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find a way to get him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.44,0:43:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这段时间如果媒体\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the meantime if the press.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.57,0:43:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓着这场意外不放的话 我们的股市会遭受重创\N{\fnArial\fs30}gets hold of this accident, our stock will crater.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.10,0:44:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就让狄龙先生继续没有存在感吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So make sure that this Mr. Dillon stays invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.60,0:44:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事以后说不定对我们还会有用处\N{\fnArial\fs30}This could prove useful for us in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.72,0:45:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.71,0:45:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 别挡道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move over! Get out of the street!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.63,0:45:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.94,0:46:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.77,0:46:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.77,0:46:11.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 临时把你约出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for the spontaneous hour, but it was kind of…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.04,0:46:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我 我不介意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know. Spontaneous, it's alright. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.40,0:46:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得现在我们可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I just figured it was time,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.97,0:46:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以重新成为好朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know…time for us try to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.98,0:46:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 好啊 这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends, yeah, that's…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.60,0:46:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}great.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.72,0:46:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让我们的关系太复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't want us to be complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.19,0:46:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天才跟别人说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said that to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.15,0:46:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我讨厌复杂 - 简单就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I hate complicated. - Keep it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.43,0:46:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好好 这样很好 但我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay great, great, yeah, yeah, alright but I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.96,0:46:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们要成为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we were to be friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.39,0:46:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得约法三章\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we gotta establish some ground rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.99,0:46:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约法三章 - 对啊 约法三章\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some ground rules? - Yes, some ground rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.94,0:46:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比如这个 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like that. - Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.77,0:47:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看看 就是这种笑容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…look, that laugh, that laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.26,0:47:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后不许这么笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.93,0:47:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能这么笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My laugh's off the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.53,0:47:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得笑得更讨人厌点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta figure out a more annoying laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.34,0:47:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这笑得还是太迷人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's still adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.03,0:47:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不迷人呢 你要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not adorable. What're you doing…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.60,0:47:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 我也有一条规矩 - 说来听听\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, I've got a ground rule. - Oh, you, what? What's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.34,0:47:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许用你深邃的大眼睛看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er…don't tell me that I look amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.95,0:47:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,赞扬我很美 行么\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your big brown doe eyes, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.34,0:47:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认真说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really serious about that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.45,0:47:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完了 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh no… - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.55,0:47:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我又想到了一条 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've just figured out the next ground rule. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.98,0:47:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.95,0:47:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再 别再这样揉你的鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more…no more this nose rub that you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.06,0:47:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样吗 - 别以为我没看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This? - Don't think I haven't noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.86,0:47:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要怎么办 现在可是过敏期\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do? It's allergy season.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.21,0:47:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直要了我的命啊 我要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is killing me, I gotta…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.82,0:47:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚刚质疑我的规则 我不玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you just spitting in the face with my ground rules, I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.10,0:47:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.13,0:47:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先去买冰淇淋 然后我就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}First we get ice cream, then I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.30,0:48:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umm, yeah, so I did that…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.88,0:48:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我就彻底爱上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got completely addicted.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.00,0:48:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个卖韩国肉丸的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}to this place that has Korean meatballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.60,0:48:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你去过吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you been there? - No, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.11,0:48:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里超棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's mind-blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.83,0:48:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 在第六大道上 你很爱那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That place is at 6th, I know, you love it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.31,0:48:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.84,0:48:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我喜欢那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know I love it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.64,0:48:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos' umm…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.11,0:49:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你告诉过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cos' you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.86,0:49:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是它上个月才开张\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just opened last month.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.70,0:49:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在跟踪我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.02,0:49:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 多久一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. How often?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.72,0:49:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候 一天一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just once a day, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.01,0:49:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候更频繁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes more.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.31,0:49:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}why?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.05,0:49:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想要保护我吗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To make sure I'm safe? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.03,0:49:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我能接近你的唯一方法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's the closest I can get still being with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.55,0:50:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要搬去英国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm moving to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.77,0:50:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.77,0:50:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我申请了牛津大学的奖学金\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a, um…I'm up for a scholarship to Oxford.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.19,0:50:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,分子医学专业的\N{\fnArial\fs30}in molecular medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.44,0:50:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,竞争者有两名\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's between me and this.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.86,0:50:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们要进行面试\N{\fnArial\fs30}other kid and there's this oral exam we've to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.30,0:50:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个候选人是大一新生 但他只有14岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's like a freshman in college but he's fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.77,0:50:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们俩的机会均等 我希望自己能被选上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it could be him but might be me, I hope it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.78,0:50:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,选上的话 我就要搬去英国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna go to…gonna be moving to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.57,0:50:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是很期待的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm really excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.88,0:50:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…er…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.41,0:50:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去英国啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}England?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.72,0:51:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,总部 请求支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Station, I need a ten-eighty-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.87,0:51:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一队人去杜菲广场的南角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send out the units to the southend corner of Duffy Square.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.78,0:52:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家请让开 快让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody get out of the way, please. Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.26,0:52:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 把你的手从电缆上移开 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, get your hands away from the cable, right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.31,0:52:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 把你的手从电缆上移开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, get your hands away from the cables!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.15,0:52:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me see your hands, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.11,0:52:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在原地 不要动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay right where you are. Do not move.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.49,0:52:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动 趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze! Get down, on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.80,0:52:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down on the ground, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.49,0:52:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们停下 - 马上趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - Get down on the ground, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.00,0:52:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的错 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.99,0:52:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.72,0:52:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.71,0:52:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看见我了 他们看见我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see me…they see me…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.33,0:53:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看见我了 看见我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see me…they see me…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.57,0:53:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上趴下 - 别 别这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On the ground, now! - No…stop. Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.28,0:53:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.42,0:53:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 到此为止了 怪胎 - 等等 这不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's over, freak. - Wait, it's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.29,0:53:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.18,0:53:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.22,0:53:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真庆幸你不是一位骑警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're not one of those cops that ride a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.14,0:53:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有警员注意 停止开枪 等我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}All team members…hold your fire and wait for my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.75,0:53:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,停止开枪 再重复一遍 停止开枪原地待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire, I repeat, hold your fire and stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.81,0:53:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下 请停下 - 嘿 亮闪闪的这位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop, stop it! - Yo, Sparkle!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.62,0:54:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…how are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.91,0:54:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你啊 - 是呀 是我 你是哪位\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's you? - Yeah, I know it's me, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.68,0:54:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不记得我了吗 - 我见过你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't remember me? - No, should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.16,0:54:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我走在街上的时候差点被车撞到 你抱住了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I walked into the street, the car almost hit me. You swung me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.14,0:54:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你救了我 你说你需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved me. You said you needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.93,0:54:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你啊 抱着图纸的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy, you're the guy with the blue prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.65,0:54:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 抱着图纸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, blue prints.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.19,0:54:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我记得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I remember you,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.78,0:54:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然记得你 你是我的耳目嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I remember you, you're my eyes and ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.69,0:54:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呃 你叫什么来着 – 你怎么能忘了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Er…what's your name again? - How could you forget me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.06,0:54:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我记得的 我记得的 别告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I do, I know it, I know it, don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.04,0:54:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我叫迈克斯 - 你是叫迈克斯吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Max. - Is it Max?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.19,0:54:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.01,0:54:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我刚才没认出来 你看起来很不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I didn't recognize you with the…you look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.78,0:54:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.86,0:54:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's going on with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.19,0:54:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白的 我相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see, I…I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.87,0:54:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这感觉很陌生 我浑身充满了能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's strange…the power that I got so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.44,0:54:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,充满了愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got so much anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.66,0:54:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麻烦让一让 - 我明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.85,0:54:58.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你也不想在这儿 看得出你很恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see you don't want to be here, I can see you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.99,0:55:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不知道自己到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}cos' you don't know what's happening to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.90,0:55:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你不想伤害任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see that you don't want to hurt anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.70,0:55:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一切都会好的 - 我已经瞄准了 等待指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's going to be alright. - I got a clear shot, standing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.82,0:55:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想要他们再向我开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want them shooting me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.58,0:55:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会再这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not going to shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.92,0:55:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计们 这是我的兄弟迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, this is my buddy Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.15,0:55:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你们提起过他 别再朝他开枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you about Max. No one shoots at Max!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.03,0:55:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 就只有你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, just you and me talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.16,0:55:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 喔 待在那儿别动 先别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa… Stay right there, stay right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.80,0:55:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心脚下 那可是电网\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be careful with the grid, it's the electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.06,0:55:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是 我只是希望大家能注意到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…I just wanted everyone to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.92,0:55:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他如果有所行动 你就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he makes a move, you take that shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.85,0:55:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你和我 我们离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you come with me, go somewhere we can talk,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.71,0:55:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,去别的地方谈谈 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}away from all these people…okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.40,0:55:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no…stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.38,0:56:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spidey…Spidey…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.27,0:56:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个愚蠢的怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stupid freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.14,0:56:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚吧 傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck off, dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.54,0:56:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他欺骗了我 开枪射我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lied to me, he shot me…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.57,0:56:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.34,0:56:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太自私了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.71,0:56:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.54,0:56:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你陷害我 - 不 我没有陷害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You set me up. - No…I didn't set you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.45,0:56:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你骗了我 - 不 我是在帮你 让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You lied to me. - No, I'm trying to help you, let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.70,0:57:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是我的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.77,0:57:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候点蜡烛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's time for me to light my candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.21,0:58:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有看到蜘蛛侠吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have visual on Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.05,0:58:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到蜘蛛侠了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone…have visual on Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.89,0:59:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.16,0:59:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迈克·约翰 - 干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike. Big John. - Nice job!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.78,0:59:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好伙计们 很高兴和你们合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work fellas. It's a pleasure doing business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.27,0:59:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.79,0:59:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}England?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.81,0:59:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.83,0:59:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谈话愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.81,1:00:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于此次突发事件的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our coverage of this breaking story.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.11,1:00:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们连线现场记者杰西卡·奥布\N{\fnArial\fs30}begins with Jessica Abo at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.76,1:00:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 站在我身边的是两位目击者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. We're standing here with two eyewitnesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.30,1:00:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将告诉我们刚才发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}who are going to tell us what they just saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.00,1:00:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,请告诉我们 你们觉得蜘蛛侠是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell us. How do you think Spider-Man did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.57,1:00:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是如何打败刚才那个怪物的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think he beat this creature.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.03,1:00:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键在于他的衣服 一定是橡胶材质的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it got to be rubberised, Spidey's suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.08,1:00:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是为什么他不会触电致死\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's why he didn't get electrocuted.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.82,1:00:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是某种氯丁橡胶 如果是我的话也会用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably some kind of neoprene. That's what I'll use, honestly…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.56,1:00:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢你们接受采访\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much for the two of you,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.05,1:00:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前为止很多问题还尚未有答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you can tell so many questions remain unanswered.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.59,1:00:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们会为您带来事件的最新消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we will bring you the latest information as it becomes available.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.17,1:00:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢收看杰西卡来自现场的报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now, Jessica Abo for New York l…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.42,1:00:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当生活令你感到孤立无援 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When life leaves you high and dry ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.61,1:01:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我会第一时间赶到 只要你有所需要 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'll be at your door tonight if you need help. If you need help ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.49,1:01:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 哪怕要夺走城市的光亮 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'll shut down the city lights ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.82,1:01:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 又或是让我欺骗使诈乞讨行贿 只要你安然无恙 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'll lie, cheat. I'll beg and bribe to make you well, to make you well ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.71,1:01:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 当敌人来袭 我愿带你远离纷扰 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ When enemies are at your door, I'll carry you way from more ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.14,1:01:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只要你有所需要 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ If you need help, if you need help ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.85,1:01:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 若你的希望即将破灭 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Your hope dangling by a string ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.97,1:01:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我将分担你的苦难 只求你安然无恙 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'll share in your suffering to make you well, to make you well ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.80,1:01:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 请让我相信 你也会这般待我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Give me reasons to believe that you would do the same for me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.62,1:01:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 这样我便会毫无保留为你付出 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And I would do it for you for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.92,1:01:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我对你的爱不会减少 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Baby I'm not moving on ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.90,1:01:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 即使你已离开了我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I love you long after you're gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.97,1:01:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我将为你赴汤蹈火 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ For you, for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.94,1:01:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你永远不会孤单而眠 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You will never sleep along ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.02,1:01:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你的离开不会改变我的爱恋 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I love you long after you gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.25,1:01:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我将为你赴汤蹈火 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ For you, for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.21,1:02:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我对你的爱不会减少 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Baby I'm not moving on ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.18,1:02:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 即使你已离开了我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I love you long after you're gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.36,1:02:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 像鼓声般永不停歇 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Like a drum baby don't stop beating ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.32,1:02:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 像鼓声般永不停歇 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Like a drum baby don't stop beating ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.41,1:02:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我的心将像这鼓点永远为你跳动 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Like a drum my heart never stops beating for you ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.77,1:02:18.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（难道我连你也要失去吗）
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.91,1:02:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你的离开不会改变我的爱恋 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And long after you're gone gone gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.57,1:02:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无论历经多久 我的爱也不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I love you long after you're gone gone gone ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.74,1:02:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,网络投票显示 民众对蜘蛛侠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Online polls show a sudden uptake.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.63,1:02:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持率急剧上升\N{\fnArial\fs30}in public sentiment in favour of the web-crawler.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.51,1:02:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今夜的纽约市似乎欠了他一份恩情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight it would seem New York City owes him a debt of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.11,1:03:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,新一代武装装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next generation military body armor.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.63,1:03:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,性能包括 更强的机动性 战时伤病治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Features include enhanced mobility, battlefield injury repair.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.50,1:03:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,神经系统的实时反馈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Direct nervous system interface.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.10,1:03:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般的蜘蛛 与人类的细胞不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the common household spider, umm…Unlike human cells,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.67,1:03:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们拥有自我治愈的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a containment power to self-heal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.06,1:03:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括重症感染 组织损伤等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}from severe infection, tissue damage, etc.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.87,1:03:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们使用放射性同位素与可兼容的人类DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}and so we used radioactive isotope with compatible human DNA…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.13,1:03:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎收看贾林斯博士的科教频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome…to Dr. Jallings science investigator.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.38,1:03:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们要来谈谈电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we're going to be talking about electricity.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.18,1:03:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池 绝缘体 电流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batteries, insulators, electromagnetic current.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.50,1:03:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池可以承受大量输入的电荷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Batteries can withstand a lot of incoming charges.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.19,1:03:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池的容量越大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more powerful the battery,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.56,1:03:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它所能承受的电荷也就越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bigger the charge it can withstand.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.96,1:04:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果输入的电荷超过了放出的电荷\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if the incoming charge exeeds the outgoing charge,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.13,1:04:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池就会爆炸 爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}the battery might explode! Explode!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.52,1:04:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,在进行此类实验时 请务必做好防护措施\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conducting experiments like this, always wear protective gear.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.98,1:04:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为你不是无敌的 - 我需要块更大的电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not invincible. - We're gonna need a bigger battery.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.00,1:05:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁呀 - 彼得 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Pete, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.51,1:05:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 哈利 现在几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Harry, what time is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.33,1:05:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,很迟了 又或是大清早 不清楚 我一晚上没睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late, early, I don't know. I've been up all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.48,1:05:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要见你一面 - 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to see you. - You alright…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.37,1:05:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really, Pete.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.30,1:05:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快要死了 但我想你能救我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying…but I think you can help save my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.09,1:05:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在看到的是世界首例人类与蜘蛛的杂交体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking at the world's first Human-Spider hybrids.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.69,1:05:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的设想是从它们的腺体中提取毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hope is to extract the venom from their glands.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.95,1:05:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,再将其转化为治愈病变细胞的药剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turn that into a cure, an agent that heals diseased cells.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.10,1:05:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能被治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I can be cured…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.51,1:05:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想这对那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine what this could do.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.78,1:05:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔茨海默病患者和癌症患者意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}for other diseases like Alzheimer's even cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.35,1:05:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从未进展到人体试验阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never made it to human trials.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.59,1:05:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,历经14年的研究却一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fourteen years of research and nothing to show for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.25,1:05:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except maybe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.53,1:06:02.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（惊艳！首张蜘蛛侠清晰照片）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.64,1:06:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蜘蛛侠 - 跟他有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spider-Man. - What about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.09,1:06:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被其中一只蜘蛛咬了 并且成功变异\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was bitten by one of those things then worked.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.67,1:06:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道这其中的原理 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how and I don't know why…but.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.16,1:06:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能做所有蜘蛛能做的事 包括自我治愈\N{\fnArial\fs30}he can do everything else a spider can, including self-heal.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.14,1:06:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.51,1:06:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要他的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need his blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.53,1:06:38.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（搜索）
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.69,1:06:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要蜘蛛侠的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need Spider-Man's blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.69,1:06:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那可以救我的命 - 那可能行不通 哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It will save my life. - It may not, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.89,1:06:57.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许没那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not be that simple.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.66,1:06:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道科特·康纳斯发生了什么 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what happened to Curt Connors, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.73,1:07:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他太弱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connors was weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.56,1:07:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我不同 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is me, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.43,1:07:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得你开着辆采血车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think you can just set up a van.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.90,1:07:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会来献血了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have him donate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.26,1:07:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的意思是 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm sure he's.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.41,1:07:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人到处举着针头 他会敏锐地察觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}sensitive about people shoving needles…and.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.23,1:07:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,敏锐地察觉么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably sensitive?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.70,1:07:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well then,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.62,1:07:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你可以直接敏锐地告诉我他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you can just sensitively tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.42,1:07:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我自己去求他 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and I will just go ask him myself. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.95,1:07:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你照到了他 - 所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You took his picture. - So?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.40,1:07:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.92,1:07:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 我那是从很远的地方照的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, I took a picture from a long way,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.73,1:07:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了长镜头 我并不认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I use a long lens, I don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.63,1:07:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重新想了想你在河边说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put together what you said at the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.34,1:07:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.12,1:07:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说蜘蛛侠给了人们希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how he gives people hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.49,1:07:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.06,1:07:54.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中央服务器被访问 搜索中）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.28,1:07:59.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（限制该员工的所有访问 追踪目标位置）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.62,1:08:03.91,Note,0,0,0,0,,（查无此人）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.24,1:08:05.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（无法搜索 请联系管理员）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.28,1:08:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你答应吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just say yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.75,1:08:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别背对着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't turn your back on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.04,1:08:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和我爸一个下场 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to end up like my father, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.69,1:08:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.80,1:08:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 求你了 我不想那样死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter, please. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.58,1:08:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会试着找到蜘蛛侠的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to try and find Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.00,1:08:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 保安怎么会来这里 - 太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, what's the security doing here? - That's so weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.54,1:09:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 斯泰西小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Miss Stacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.40,1:09:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.91,1:09:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这干嘛呢 - 你又在这干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.31,1:09:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不在这 去别的楼层看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not here. Check another floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.84,1:09:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惹上麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.17,1:09:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 那人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Who's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.42,1:09:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,基因实验室里发生了一场事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was an accident in the genomic lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.07,1:09:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们想要掩盖真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're covering it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.58,1:09:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有昨晚在时代广场的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I found out that guy from Times Square last night,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.34,1:09:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过他 他是这里的一名电力工程师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I met him. He was an electrical engineer in the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.52,1:09:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 他可喜欢蜘蛛侠了 狂热粉丝级别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he loved Spider-Man, by the way, he was like a fanatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.67,1:10:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我是没感受到他的爱意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get a love vibe last night,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.12,1:10:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只感受到了他想要电死我的信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got more of a wanting him to kill me with his electricity vibe.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.55,1:10:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是表达爱意的一种方式嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually kind of what it's like to love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.00,1:10:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在电脑上搜索他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was searching for him in the computer.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.85,1:10:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但所有相关资料都被清除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the files were erased.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.10,1:10:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 彻底清楚了 - 这公司的典型做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's completely erased. - That's Oscorp.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.76,1:10:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你怎么会在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.39,1:10:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为哈利来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.94,1:10:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奥斯本吗 - 他快要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Osborn? - He's dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.94,1:10:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 他快要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - He's dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.55,1:10:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他觉得唯一能救他的是 我的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he thinks the only thing going that's gonna his life is my blood,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.97,1:10:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider Man's blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.71,1:10:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是据我所知 如果我给了他 只会害了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I know, if I give it to him, it could kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.33,1:10:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or something worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.54,1:10:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是保洁储物间 格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the maintenance closet, Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.55,1:10:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是老掉牙的藏身处啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the most cliche hiding place you could have chosen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.61,1:10:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 躲在这里真是蠢爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm…sorry. - This is the stupidest hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.25,1:10:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是抱歉没把您带去高端的藏身处啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't take us to the Bahamas of hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.49,1:10:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和你聊英国的事情 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk to you about England is because…I don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.70,1:11:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你刚刚吻了我 - 对不起 情不自禁就\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You just kissed me. - I know, I'm sorry, I couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.34,1:11:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.14,1:11:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有点匆忙 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It felt a little rushed. - I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.27,1:11:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划是这样的 你去乘电梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the plan. You get to the elevator,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.74,1:11:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我来想办法引开他们 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going to distract them, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.22,1:11:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我竟然把一杯热拿铁洒了你全身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I just spilled a hot latte all over you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.76,1:11:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也没做 哎呀 不是我干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do that! Oh, and you too!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.97,1:11:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别跑 别跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right there! Stay right there!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.67,1:11:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 等一等嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.34,1:11:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.27,1:11:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉咯 我今天笨手笨脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry…I'm all thumbs today.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.21,1:11:52.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 格温·斯黛西 - 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gwen Stacy. - Oh my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.70,1:11:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.96,1:11:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's ok.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.27,1:12:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 我是哈利 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Harry. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.00,1:12:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是彼得的老朋友了 - 嗯 我知道你是谁 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm an old friend of Peter's. - Yea, I know who you are. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.88,1:12:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚有点冒失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was kind of rushing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.72,1:12:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 很抱歉他没介绍我们认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm sorry he never introduced us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.53,1:12:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们已经分手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you two had broken up.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.32,1:12:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 分手了 这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we had, it's…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.53,1:12:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点复杂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.48,1:12:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 复杂 - 彼得就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Complicated. - He's Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.98,1:12:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他有关的事情都不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is always complicated with Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.74,1:12:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对啊 - 但这正是他需要你的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, yeah, it's…you're right. - But that's why he needs you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.31,1:12:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.69,1:12:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮助他选择该走的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help him make his choices clear.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.12,1:12:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴认识你 哈利 - 幸会 格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice to meet you, Harry. - Yeah, it' such a pleasure, Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.29,1:13:05.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（收治精神病犯人）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.13,1:13:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经历了一场可怕的事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been in a terrible accident.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.52,1:13:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是卡夫卡医生 我是来帮助你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dr. Kafka. I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.47,1:13:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是了 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you are, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.07,1:14:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才准备了军用生物刺激电极\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you prepared a military grade, biostimulate electrode.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.79,1:14:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,和高强度电容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}High intensity capacitors.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.66,1:14:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oscorp工业制造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind they make at Oscorp.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.74,1:14:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备这些都是为了帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of this because you're trying to help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.59,1:14:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.18,1:14:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来研究你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to study you,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.36,1:14:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,来查明你是什么东西 又为何存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}to understand what you are, why you're.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.31,1:14:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会得到我要的结果的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will get results.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.69,1:14:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always do.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.92,1:14:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没忘记这所监狱的动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do realize you locked me in a prison…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.44,1:14:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是电吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that runs on electricity.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.66,1:14:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能从墙里和我的血管里感受到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it in the walls, I can feel it in my veins.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.23,1:14:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生 无论你怎么做 都是无法控制它们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what you do, Doc, you can't contain it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.47,1:14:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是大自然的力量 而我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a force of nature, like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.14,1:15:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想知道我有多强大吗 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to know how powerful I am? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.39,1:15:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.31,1:15:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good…good.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.30,1:15:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想知道 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dying to know, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.48,1:15:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你最好确保这次能杀死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'd better make damn sure that you kill me this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.50,1:15:20.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为如果你做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because if you don't…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.47,1:15:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会吞噬一切光亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonnna kill the light.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.56,1:15:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市里的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So everyone in this city,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.03,1:15:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,都将感受到我暗无天日的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}is gonna know how to feel, to live in my world.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.90,1:15:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个没有电也没有善意的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world without power. A world without mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.00,1:15:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个没有蜘蛛侠的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world without Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.92,1:15:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人将目睹我的真实面目\N{\fnArial\fs30}And everyone will be able to see me for who I truly am.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.69,1:15:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.53,1:15:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道吗 我是电光人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you know? I am Electro.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.13,1:15:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 已达到电力承载最高值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Electrical restrain capacity reaches escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.67,1:15:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,立即启动禁闭程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiate lockdown procedure, immmediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.14,1:16:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊 电光人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very impressive, Electro.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.15,1:16:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁闭程序 启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lockdown initiating.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.87,1:16:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅伯母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt May?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.32,1:16:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在做什么 - 这些是什么时候做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - When did you do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.24,1:16:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是不是有事瞒着我了 梅伯母\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something your not telling me, Aunt May.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.26,1:16:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我提到我父母 你都不敢看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I mention my parents, your eyes go down.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.02,1:16:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有事瞒着我 在对我撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're not telling me something. You're lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.18,1:16:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你很爱我 - 我没有 - 我也很爱你 但你撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you love me… - I don't. - I know you love me… But you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.62,1:16:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 那毕竟是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell me. It's my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.74,1:16:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他是你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he was your father…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.50,1:17:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那并没能阻止他的离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that didn't seem to stop him from leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.56,1:17:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要知道事情的真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.62,1:17:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实就是 你父母把你留了在我家门前\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is that your parents left you here, on our door-step.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.44,1:17:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,年幼的你 生活就此被颠覆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This little boy whose world was turned upside down with no explanation.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.94,1:17:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尽了最大努力照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did the best, we could.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.90,1:17:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的本伯父和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Uncle Ben, he and I.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.40,1:17:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁会来这样照顾你 保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who else was going to care for you and protect you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.58,1:17:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,担心你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And worry about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.83,1:17:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸吗 他做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.82,1:17:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我替你擦鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the one who wiped your nose,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.62,1:17:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼着你刷牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}who made you brush your teeth…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.98,1:17:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你做作业 洗你的脏内衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}and do your homework. And washed your dirty underwear.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.25,1:17:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 这个没文化没知识的伯母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me! You stupid, nonscientific aunt,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.34,1:17:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个不知该如何养家\N{\fnArial\fs30}who doesn't know how to make ends meet…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.13,1:17:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能和年轻人一起上护士学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}who has to take nursing classes, with 22 year old kids,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.52,1:17:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能供你上学的伯母\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can pay for you to go to college.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.99,1:17:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有本的日子 我真的不知该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't know how to do this without Ben. I don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.34,1:17:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而此刻 你却满脑子想着那完美的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're dreaming about your perfect father…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.69,1:17:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个从未出现过的爸爸 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was never here. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.57,1:18:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会告诉你的 你是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I won't tell you. You're my boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.80,1:18:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我而言 你就是我的孩子 我不想伤害你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I'm concerned, you're my boy. And I won't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.17,1:18:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的孩子 你是我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your boy. You're my everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.25,1:18:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好 足够好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're enough. You're more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.79,1:18:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会 但我还是想知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what this is about.Don't get that twisted.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.46,1:18:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很爱你 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you so much. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.13,1:18:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.53,1:18:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅伯母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aunt May…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.01,1:18:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.85,1:18:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.68,1:18:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把我知道的都告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.47,1:19:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但你也许会难以接受 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But It will hurt you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.80,1:19:09.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,葬礼后的几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few days after the funeral…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.55,1:19:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个政府工作人员来找我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two government men came to see us.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.29,1:19:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说 你爸爸和诺曼·奥斯本\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said the genetic research…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.30,1:19:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起进行的那个基因研究 具有巨大的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}that your father was doing with Norman Osborn was very valuable.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.40,1:19:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人愿意花重金购买\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that people would pay a lot for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.08,1:19:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他带着研究结果跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why he ran off with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.21,1:19:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说他是个叛徒 我不敢相信 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said he was a traitor. I couldn't believe it, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.34,1:19:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说他背叛了自己的好友 所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told us he betrayed his best friend, all of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.62,1:19:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了金钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.21,1:19:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 这说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it…It doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.34,1:19:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 我也不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know. I didn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.52,1:19:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这完全说不通 - 彼得 我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This doesn't make any sense… - Peter… I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.38,1:19:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多年了 我在脑海中想了一遍又一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}For so long. I would play it over and over in my head.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.66,1:19:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底错过了什么 到底哪里不对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What had I missed. What had I missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.17,1:19:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个平凡又低调的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just a normal unasuming guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.11,1:20:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一件破实验室制服穿了20年\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wore the same ratty lab coat for 20 years…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.19,1:20:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天早上7点 乘着D线地铁去上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took the D train to work, at seven every morning…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.40,1:20:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上6点准时回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}came home at 6 every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.37,1:20:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.80,1:20:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许每个人都有不为人知的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe everyone has a part of themselves they hide…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.09,1:20:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使是对于他们爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even from the people they love.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.46,1:20:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.95,1:20:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.48,1:20:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯本先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Osborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.82,1:20:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抬头 是你在找我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look up. Think you were looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.55,1:20:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我所看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can not believe my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.62,1:20:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.61,1:21:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是我想找的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the man I wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.48,1:21:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和彼得聊过了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You… talked to Peter? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.09,1:21:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想帮你 奥斯本先生 我真的很想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to help you, Mr. Osborn. I really, really do.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.12,1:21:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不能把血给你 至少现在不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't give you my blood. Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.98,1:21:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 那样太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.59,1:21:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们的血不相容 你会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If our blood is not compatible, you could die.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.66,1:21:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经离死不远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm already dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.98,1:21:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的血不会让我多死一次 - 但可能使你恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your blood can't make me die more. - But it could do something worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.17,1:21:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.06,1:21:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright. How much?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.48,1:21:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多少什么 - 多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much what? - How much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.67,1:21:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘船还是一架飞机 还是钱 你要多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boat? You want a plane? You want money? How much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.46,1:21:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想要你的钱 - 得了吧 每个人都想要我的钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want your money. - Everybody wants my money.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.83,1:22:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.15,1:22:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是大家的救星吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you save people.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.69,1:22:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在做的不就是拯救他人的性命么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that's what you do, is you save people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.50,1:22:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却要眼睁睁地看着我死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just gonna let me die.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.06,1:22:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在是在保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to protect you right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.67,1:22:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只是在保护你自己罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.61,1:22:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是需要一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…We just need a bit more time…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.93,1:22:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有时间了 你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not have time. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.70,1:22:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.64,1:22:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个骗子 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fraud, Spider Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.46,1:23:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能和你说句话吗 - 我在赶时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I to talk to you for a second. - I'm running late right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.09,1:23:09.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一会会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only gonna take a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.70,1:23:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点时间 就一件事 说完我就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me some time. One thing. Then I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.51,1:23:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情乱套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.04,1:23:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母 我所了解的一切都是谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad my mum, everything I thought about them, lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.41,1:23:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谎言 谎言 谎言 什么都说不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lies, lies, lies. Nothings make sense any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.10,1:23:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 还有哈利的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here we are. I gotta figure out things with Harry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.00,1:23:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然想救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because, of course I want to save him. You know.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.82,1:23:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想救他 因为他是我最好的哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to sve him, because he's my best pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.80,1:23:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的血可能奏效 也可能失效\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if my blood works? But what if it doesn't?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.48,1:23:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 什么都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.30,1:23:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…god.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.17,1:23:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,脑子一片空白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.20,1:23:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 我现在唯一能想到的只有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing I keep coming back to… Gwen is…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.29,1:23:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯泰西小姐 我带你上楼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Stacy, shall I take you upstairs?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.85,1:23:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.40,1:23:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我已经迟到了 能再等我一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry…I'm already late… Can I have just one moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.98,1:23:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.65,1:24:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里是哪里 - 牛津大学的最后一轮面试\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we? - This is my last interview for Oxford.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.66,1:24:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛津 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxford… I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.57,1:24:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思打扰你 尊贵的女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to bother you, my fair lady, madam.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.50,1:24:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁 我是约翰·霍普金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who am I? I am John Hopkins.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.43,1:24:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自哈佛的年轻教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm one of the young professors at Harvard,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.98,1:24:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正想让她来加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm trying to get her to be in my…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.69,1:24:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}part of my team, for a while now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.02,1:24:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我认识的最佳人选 一位科学天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she is the best person I know, and a scientific genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.14,1:24:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,总而言之 天佑女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, "God save the Queen, "
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.79,1:24:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚才发生的一切 我表示抱歉 - 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry that everything's happening right… - Peter!!!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.18,1:24:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能再等我一会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you just wait for one second?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.04,1:24:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.42,1:24:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得 你刚刚想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter. What do you want to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.22,1:24:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唯一能想到的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the one thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.77,1:24:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须得去英国 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go to England, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.70,1:24:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我来说很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.41,1:24:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们的人生轨迹不同吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we are just on different paths right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.66,1:24:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.61,1:25:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的轨迹不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just going different ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.81,1:25:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了 我真的得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.27,1:25:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.59,1:25:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.90,1:25:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 刚才抱歉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.30,1:26:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天早上7点 乘着D线地铁去上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took the D train to work, every morning at seven,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.93,1:26:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上6点准时回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}came home at 6 every evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.60,1:26:29.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗斯福 地铁 D列车）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.44,1:26:32.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（运输研究：废弃车站）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.50,1:26:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯福秘密站台 61号铁路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roosevelt Secret station, Track 61.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.02,1:26:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,建在珀欣广场下面 纽约市D线的隐蔽分支段\N{\fnArial\fs30}A secret subterranean extension of New York's D line under Pershing Square.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.63,1:26:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里罗斯福总统能被秘密转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Originally built to tranport President Franklin Roosevelt away from the public eye,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.09,1:26:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对众人隐瞒他小儿麻痹的病情\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep his polio secret for the American people.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.67,1:26:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥斯本先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Osborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.88,1:27:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧 有什么我能帮到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alright? Is there anything I can get you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.91,1:27:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你能让那些蜘蛛起死回生 否则没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, unless you can bring those spiders back to life.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.68,1:27:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蜘蛛 - 那些被他们销毁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spiders? - The ones that they destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.08,1:27:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,「为了重塑投资者的信心」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To restore investors confidence."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.29,1:27:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧 费利西亚 放一天假\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home, Felicia. Take the day off.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.89,1:27:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.38,1:27:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想还有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there may be another way,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.14,1:27:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,得到你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get what you're looking for…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.16,1:27:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到门肯和其中一个安保负责人说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I overheard Menken talking with one of our security's head.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.77,1:27:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在毁掉那批蜘蛛前提取出了毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before they destroyed the spiders, they had the venom extracted.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.14,1:27:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.88,1:27:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样他们既不会惹官司\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way they could comply with the.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.99,1:27:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可以留着数据以备不时之需\N{\fnArial\fs30}lawsuits but still keep the data whenever it became useful.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.14,1:27:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它在哪 - 这栋楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is it? - Somewhere in the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.67,1:28:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个写着「特殊项目」的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere off the books called "Special Projects".
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.82,1:28:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,特殊项目 上一次进入 一小时前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Special Projects. Last received entry: 1 hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.04,1:28:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,由哈利·奥斯本批准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approved by Harry Osborn…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.67,1:28:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入档案Ravenscroft\N{\fnArial\fs30}Accessing Ravenscroft archive.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.30,1:28:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,713号文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}File seven-one-three.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.13,1:28:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.58,1:28:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,71号文件 对象 迈克斯·狄龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}File seven-one. Subject: Dillon, Max.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.05,1:28:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我会吞噬一切光亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and then I'm going to kill the light,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.44,1:28:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这座城市的所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so everyone in this city.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.01,1:28:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会知道活在我的世界里是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}will discover how it feels to live in my world.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.98,1:28:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个没有电的世界 一个没有蜘蛛侠的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world without power. A world without Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.54,1:28:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告 你的访问权限被撤销\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warning. Your user access has been revoked.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.70,1:28:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很忙 你们不能进去 他很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's busy. You can't go in there. He's busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.46,1:28:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么 - 更切题的问题是你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you do? - A more relevant question is what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.58,1:29:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个员工死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}An employee is killed and.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.86,1:29:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你作为CEO却把事情掩盖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your first action as CEO, you covered it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.26,1:29:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 是你掩盖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you covered it up and then.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.58,1:29:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后以我的名义把他关在那个鬼地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}you buried him in the bug house using my name.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.05,1:29:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ravenscroft是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ravenscroft is a timeworn.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.33,1:29:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来研究提高心理素质的老机构\N{\fnArial\fs30}Institution devoted to mental improvement.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.12,1:29:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里用人做实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're experimenting on people in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.58,1:29:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,进步得有人奠基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Progress has its stepping stones.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.01,1:29:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 考虑到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, in light of your.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.45,1:29:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺诈性犯罪行为 你已经被\N{\fnArial\fs30}deceptive criminal actions, you have been…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.27,1:29:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么表述的委婉一点 开除了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how do I put this gently… fired.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.43,1:29:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想把我也埋起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going to bury me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.53,1:29:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我来说你已经半身在地下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks to me like you're halfway in the ground already.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.18,1:29:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是时间问题 你会死得很难看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a matter of time. You're going to die a horrible death,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.02,1:29:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}like your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.41,1:29:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,区别是 没人会怀念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The difference is, no one is going to miss you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.82,1:29:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他赶出去 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him out. - Wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.94,1:29:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己会走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know my way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.51,1:30:45.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（罗斯福站）
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.69,1:32:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的名字是理查德·帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Richard Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.51,1:32:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管外界怎么形容我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever lies will be told about me,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.10,1:32:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都想要这个世界知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like the world to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.94,1:32:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oscorp已经是基因研究的先锋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oscorp was already a leader in genetic research.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.43,1:32:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在诺曼·奥斯本\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Norman Osborn made.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.58,1:32:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,和国外军事组织达成交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}a deal with a foreign military organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.50,1:32:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来继续资助我研究的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}to continue funding my research.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.14,1:33:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我发现了他们要拿我的研究去做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I discovered what they were going to use it for.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.87,1:33:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器 当然是生化武器 所以我拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons, biological weapons of course. So I refused.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.30,1:33:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是他们把我排除在计划外\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now to eliminate me from the picture,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.66,1:33:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺曼·奥斯本针对我伪造了证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Norman Osborn has falsified evidence against me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.94,1:33:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来夺取我的研究成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to take control of my work.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.86,1:33:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮助吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.42,1:33:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把门打开 我是哈利·奥斯本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yea, you can open the gate. I'm Harry Osborn.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.57,1:33:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要见一个在隔离区的病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a patient in that isolation unit I need to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.81,1:33:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔 这是来自Oscorp的奥斯本先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joe, this is Mr. Osborn from Oscorp.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.89,1:33:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉先生 没有黄色挂牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry sir, without a yellow badge,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.02,1:33:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能通过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't even pass this point.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.92,1:33:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 没有关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it doesn't matter because.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.85,1:33:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为还有一些东西是诺曼不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is something else that Norman doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.90,1:33:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注入蜘蛛体内的人体DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}The human DNA that I implanted in the spiders.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.56,1:33:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}was my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.18,1:34:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说没有我 没有我的血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that without me, without my bloodline,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.05,1:34:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,Oscorp永远不能复制或者继续我的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oscorp can never replicate or continue my experiments.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.59,1:34:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续给电光人注射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep Electro incubated,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.50,1:34:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,400毫克硫喷妥钠\N{\fnArial\fs30}with four hundred milligrams of sodium iopental…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.59,1:34:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经 我已经把能毁掉的档案都毁掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've…I've destroyed as much as possible from the archives.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.34,1:34:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有足够时间杀死所有蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I didn't have time to kill all the spiders.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.32,1:34:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个科学家 我只有一个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}So as a scientist, my choice is very clear now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.64,1:34:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须消失 我要离这里越远越好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to disappear. I have to get as far away from here as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.58,1:34:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但作为一个父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as a father.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.58,1:34:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着 我不能再见到我的儿子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it means, I may not see my boy again.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.70,1:34:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而没有什么比我的儿子彼得更重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nothing is as important to me as my son, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.27,1:34:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing in this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.66,1:34:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have a responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.92,1:34:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我所创造出的东西手里保护这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}to protect the world from what I've created.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.14,1:34:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护我的儿子远离奥斯本可以引起的祸乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}and protect him from what I know Osborn is capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.91,1:34:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们会因为我的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}People will say I'm a monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.29,1:34:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,说我是一个怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:00.67,1:35:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.83,1:35:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总以为我还有很多时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought that I'd have more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:08.64,1:35:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 爸爸 - 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad…Dad!… - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.93,1:35:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,镇静剂 关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sedation…off…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.45,1:35:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会放你出去 不过我们没多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get you out of here, alright? But we don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.82,1:35:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 我是哈利·奥斯本 我想和你做笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I'm Harry Osborn. I want to make you a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.97,1:35:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我应该杀了你 - 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should kill you. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.69,1:35:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,想得长远一点 迈克斯 我不是你要的仇人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think big, Max. I'm not the one you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.16,1:36:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找的是蜘蛛侠 而我可以帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want Spider-Man and I can give him to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.02,1:36:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要先提个要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…I need something first.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.01,1:36:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你带我进Oscorp\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to get me to Oscorp.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.31,1:36:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你进去 那是你的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get you in? You own it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.06,1:36:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是了 我们都被撵出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore. Oscorp betrayed us both.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.80,1:36:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没有你我进不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I can't get in there without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.73,1:36:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我你也离不开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you you can't get out of here without me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.76,1:36:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 有人在隔离层触发警报\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening?? - Someone pulled an alarm in the iso unit…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.50,1:36:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻叫一个拦截小队过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a containment team in there now!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.80,1:36:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能知道我要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't possibly know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.77,1:36:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你提交了输电网的设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You submitted the design for the.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.39,1:36:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们偷了你的设计现在你想要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}grid and they stole it and now you want it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.69,1:36:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是想把属于你的东西要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just wanna take back what's yours!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:38.81,1:36:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么要回来 - 这座城市所有的电力\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - All the power is in the city,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.38,1:36:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克斯 就在你指尖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, and its right at your fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.06,1:36:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你切掉所有电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you shut down the grid…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.09,1:36:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠就会来找你 我要你让他流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man will come to you and I want you to make him bleed!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.00,1:36:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞开它 撞开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break it! Break it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.13,1:36:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迈克斯 我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Max, we don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.94,1:36:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go… go… go.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.55,1:37:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一个相信你的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one reason why.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.67,1:37:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我凭什么相信你 - 因为我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I should trust you? - Because I need you!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.83,1:37:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要我 - 对 我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need me? - Yes, I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.32,1:37:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我活下去唯一的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are my only chance that I have at surviving.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.69,1:37:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要我 - 我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need me? - Yes, I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.06,1:37:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你 求你了 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you…please, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.43,1:37:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道被抛弃的感觉 求你了 迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what its like to be thrown away…Please…Max!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.24,1:37:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你 我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you! I need you!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.10,1:38:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想做我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.31,1:38:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们已经是朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we were already friends?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.92,1:38:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有过一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a friend once.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.63,1:38:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.28,1:38:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yea, me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.09,1:38:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们去抓那头蜘蛛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's go catch a spider.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.66,1:38:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你收到一条新语音\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one new voice message.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.32,1:38:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 彼得 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Peter, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.26,1:38:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我被牛津大学录取了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I got into Oxford. Woo-hoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.62,1:38:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的很激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very exciting.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.62,1:39:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚路过你家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came by your house a little bit ago and.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.32,1:39:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不在 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…You weren't there and so.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.42,1:39:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在去机场的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way to the airport right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.36,1:39:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我发现有一个暑假班\N{\fnArial\fs30}because there's this summer class I found out about.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.10,1:39:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这样也许会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I thought that it would somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.75,1:39:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松一点 我想\N{\fnArial\fs30}be easier, I guess, this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.40,1:39:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是时候放下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that maybe it's time to let this go…
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.90,1:39:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并不是因为我不爱你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's not because I don't love you,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.73,1:39:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是因为我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's actually because I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.55,1:39:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 嗯 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, umm…goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.46,1:39:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得走了 - 为什么 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to move now! - Why? What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.68,1:40:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember me?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.68,1:40:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 天哪 看看这些桌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my oh my, how the tables have turned.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.86,1:40:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's hard to admit but.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.24,1:40:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过这一切多么酷炫啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}how spectacular a move is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.03,1:40:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说的没错吧 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I right? - Right, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.41,1:40:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 那么 仙女教母\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, so, Fairy Godmother,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.08,1:40:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候让我许个愿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's time to grant me a wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.22,1:40:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要进入特殊 - 你怎么敢回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want into special… - How dare you come back in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.62,1:40:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个目中无人 一无是处 乳臭未干的混小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You recalcitrant, unworthy, defective, urchin, freak!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.69,1:40:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…God I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.89,1:40:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们想听到的答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's just not the answer we were looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.65,1:41:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备电击\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Clear."
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.61,1:41:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回到附加题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welome back to the bonus round.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.06,1:41:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,散个步吧 如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take a walk, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.47,1:41:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,电网全是你的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The grid is all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.50,1:41:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛毒液 把它给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spider venom, give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.71,1:42:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些都是什么 - 未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is all these stuff? - The future.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.88,1:42:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿一个出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Load one up.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.02,1:42:29.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有用的 我们都测试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't work. We ran every diagnostic test.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.62,1:42:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了人体试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from human trials…
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.88,1:42:33.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已经在人体上试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've actually already run human trials.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.28,1:42:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过你太蠢了不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're just too stupid to know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.98,1:42:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,注射 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.60,1:43:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,解药一直在你的手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had it all this time!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.09,1:44:21.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（检测到严重伤害）
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.18,1:44:22.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（治愈程序启动）
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.48,1:44:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.68,1:44:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停车 - 小姐 我根本没动过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop the cab. - Lady, I aint even moving!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.83,1:45:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有没有收到我的消息 - 什么消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you get my message? - What's the message?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.38,1:45:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挂在那的消息 - 噢那个 是你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The message over there. - Oh that! It was you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.86,1:45:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别装了 - 我都没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do that. - I couldn't make it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.07,1:45:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你是什么 上面说「我爱你」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you what it says, it says "I love you"
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.82,1:45:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.53,1:45:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 不过你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No offense but you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.48,1:45:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 错哪了 - 你说我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What would that be? - You're wrong about us.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.21,1:45:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在不同的轨迹上 并不是 你就是我今后要走的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}being on different path. We're not on different path, you're my path!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.79,1:45:39.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我无法时刻做到最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I'm not always going to be my best.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.96,1:45:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这世上有太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I know there's so many.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.17,1:45:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该在一起的理由 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}reasons why we shouldn't be together, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.81,1:45:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 我已经受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm tired of them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.12,1:45:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听到其中任何一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired of every sinlge one of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.88,1:45:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我要做个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm gonna to make a choice,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.72,1:45:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我选你\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I choose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.71,1:46:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.25,1:46:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}here's my thought.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.58,1:46:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}England.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.09,1:46:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.26,1:46:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟着你 你去哪我都跟着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm following you now. I'm just going to follow you everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.01,1:46:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子跟定你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to follow you the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.10,1:46:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 在英国 也有人犯罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…they got crime there…in England.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.46,1:46:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像 有一堆罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got tons of crime, it seems.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.45,1:46:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一大堆 - 对 他们有 开膛手杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tons… - Yea, they got…Jack the Ripper.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.52,1:46:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们还没抓到他 你相信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They haven't caught Jack the Ripper yet, can you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.42,1:46:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.05,1:47:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是迈克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Max?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.14,1:47:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定把整个城市的电都切断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have cut the power to the whole city.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.22,1:47:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全黑了 - 嘿 我要技术人员现在过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Totally black! - Hey, I need tech-ops up here right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.72,1:47:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,电话坏了 找个人下去叫技术人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phones are down. Somebody go down and grab tech-ops…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.94,1:47:28.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 把你们记得的都写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey… write down what you remember, people.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:28.65,1:47:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有什么应急方案 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gotta be some kind of a "Blackout plan", right?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.01,1:47:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来备用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.83,1:47:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,发电厂旁边有个重启装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an emergency reset at the power plant.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.78,1:47:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他控制了输电线\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he got the transmission lines,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.57,1:47:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就再也不能使用重启了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they never gonna get this back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.95,1:47:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎么阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I going to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:39.94,1:47:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我靠近他 他就烧坏我的蛛网发射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I get close to him, he fries my web-shooter.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.03,1:47:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你有没有试过接地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, have you tried grounding them?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.96,1:47:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,试过 我什么都试过了 橡胶 塑料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I tried everything, rubber, plastic…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.06,1:47:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你试过磁化他吗 - 我没 磁化过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you try magnetizing him? - I didn't…try magnetizing him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.18,1:47:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 还记得八年级的科学课么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, remember eighth grade Science class?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.94,1:47:54.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你用电池磁化钉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you magnetize a nail with a battery…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.17,1:47:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就会产生电荷 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You cause an electric charge. - Yes…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.26,1:48:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约塔台 这里是泛美航空273航班\N{\fnArial\fs30}New York approach…this is Pan National 273 on approach…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.74,1:48:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,能收到么\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.11,1:48:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塔台 能收到吗 - 无线电正常 不是我们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Approach, do you copy? - Radio is working, it's not us.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.75,1:48:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位不要惊慌 所有人回到车上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not panic, everyone, please return to vehicle!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.20,1:48:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到车上去 保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back to your car, remain calm!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.30,1:48:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要惊慌 所有人回到车上去 各回各家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not panic! Everyone return to your vehicle! Go to your home!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.31,1:48:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 警官 - 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Officer! - Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.51,1:48:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸乔治·斯黛西曾是这个辖区的警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father was Captain George Stacy at your precinct,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.86,1:48:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他 你能帮你什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know who he was. What can we do for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.00,1:48:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要跨接电缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumper cables!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.79,1:48:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跨接电缆 - 对 还有铜丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jumper cables? - Yes and…copper wire.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.42,1:48:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说话声音是不是比平时大 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I talking louder than I usually talk right now? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.74,1:48:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没问题的 - 好的 开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're still doing fine. - Alright, do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.68,1:48:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 再试试 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, do it. Try…try…Hurry…hurry…
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.22,1:48:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 有用了 - 这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, it works, good. - And that,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.63,1:48:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么你只是第二名 - 又秀优越了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- is why you were number two in Midtown. - Rubbing it in? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:59.59,1:49:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要走了 - 我跟你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I gotta go. - I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.32,1:49:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 你不能跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen, you're not coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:02.16,1:49:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我要去 - 不行 这太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes I am. - Come on…it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.09,1:49:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去 我看过电网设计图 还知道怎么重启系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you. I've seen the grid specs and I know how to reset the entire system.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.17,1:49:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要去 你知道你需要我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming with you. You know that you need me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.90,1:49:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 把这个关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then come with me. Shut that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:13.34,1:49:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我爱你 不要恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I love you. Don't hate me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:16.90,1:49:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:18.34,1:49:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得解决这个事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta work with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.25,1:49:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还没把发电机带回来 叫工程师来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're still not back with the generator. Get me engineering!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.42,1:49:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一个人工呼吸器 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a respirator right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.49,1:49:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来准备电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the battery operated.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.84,1:49:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.57,1:49:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看见我了么 蜘蛛侠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see me now, Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.24,1:49:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候直面我们的命运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to meet our destiny.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.52,1:50:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔台 我们遇到了一些电子干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tower, we're experiencing some kind of electrical disturbance.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.01,1:50:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,仪表一塌糊涂 雷达没有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instruments are going haywire, radar is down.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.23,1:50:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在盲飞呢 听得到么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're flying blind out here, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.86,1:50:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔台 我们在等待指示 到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tower, repeat, we're "Standby" only, what is happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.67,1:50:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 有两架飞机的航线即将交汇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, there're two inbound flights on intersecting path!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.09,1:50:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有多长时间相撞 - 四分半钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time to impact? - Four and a half minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.02,1:50:34.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,计时 快开始计时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock it… Clock it right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.18,1:50:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来不及了 蜘蛛侠 是我设计了这个电网\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late, Spider-Man. I designed this power grid.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.49,1:50:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要拿走我应得的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm gonna take back what is rightfully mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.57,1:50:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一切都臣服于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want control of everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.22,1:51:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是他们的神 - 一位叫「亮闪闪」的神么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I will be like a God to them. - A God named "Sparkles?"
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.41,1:51:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次别想了 你只有这么点本事么 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this time. Is that all you got? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.74,1:51:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.13,1:51:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好放弃没\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to give up?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:55.05,1:51:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,真感谢你 格温·斯黛西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you, Gwen Stacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.50,1:52:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,加把劲 这是你自己的骨头 肌肉 器官啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shake it off. This is your bones, muscles and your organs.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.04,1:52:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.79,1:52:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate this song!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:46.83,1:52:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠 我猜你没想到会这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man, bet you never saw this coming…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.22,1:52:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.26,1:53:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然把我绑在车上 你是野蛮人么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wired me to a car, what are you, a caveman?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.70,1:53:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该来这的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.87,1:53:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我绑在那就去战斗了 我知道怎么帮助你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tie me up to go off to war? I know how to help you!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.83,1:53:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.83,1:53:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解这个电网 我可以重启系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the grid best. I can reset the system.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.30,1:53:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该在这儿 我没胡闹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be here right now. I'm not messing around.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.39,1:53:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能留在这里 这太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be here right now. This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.12,1:53:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人能为我做决定 知道么 没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody makes my decisions for me, alright? Nobody!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:16.49,1:53:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的选择 明白么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my choice, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:19.37,1:53:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}My choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.27,1:53:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走吧 - 是我来决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - This is Mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.10,1:53:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们怎么阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now how do we stop him?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.40,1:53:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他用电 他就像个电池\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so he uses electric. He's like a battery.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.10,1:53:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以当你给电池充电过度会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happens when you overcharge a battery?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.02,1:53:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它会爆炸 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It explodes. - Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.25,1:53:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们用他自己的力量对付他 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we use his power against him, perfect!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.38,1:53:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我能重新连上电源线\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I can reconnect the power line.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.97,1:53:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我需要你重启系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what I need you to do, I need you to reset the system.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.14,1:53:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说打开电源时 你就打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay when I say you turn that power on, you turn it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.10,1:53:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 无论情况如何 - 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No matter what. - Peter…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.42,1:53:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.39,1:53:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.93,1:54:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,距相撞还有六十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 seconds to impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.60,1:55:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在打开 格温 就是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Gwen, do it now…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.55,1:55:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过载 13980.1伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overload 13980.1V.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.60,1:55:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,687号航班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 687.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.58,1:55:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是拉瓜迪亚塔台 向280方向急转\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is La Guardia tower, turn immediately to heading two-eight-zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.43,1:56:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复一遍 向280方向回避\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming traffic, I repeat two-eight-zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.09,1:56:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 大家回到岗位上 来帮他们降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay people, back to work, let's land these planes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.24,1:56:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.36,1:56:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝 有电了 大家继续工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God, alright! Alright, we're back, everyone, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.86,1:57:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还能赶上航班吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still able to make it to your flight?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.64,1:57:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温 站那儿别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen, stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.86,1:57:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.41,1:57:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你说蜘蛛侠说不的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you said Spider-Man said no,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.03,1:57:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是「你」在说「不」\N{\fnArial\fs30}you meant "You" Said "No"
Dialogue: 0,1:57:54.33,1:57:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.66,1:57:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你逼我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you made me do.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:59.31,1:58:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当你是朋友 你却背叛了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were my friend and you betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.02,1:58:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是想保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I was trying to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:08.09,1:58:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看看我 - 嘿 一切都会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at me! - Hey. It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.39,1:58:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:11.60,1:58:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本不给人希望 你剥夺了我的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give people no hope. You take it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.68,1:58:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是这样的 哈利 - 我也要剥夺你的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, Harry. - I'm going to take away yours!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:19.38,1:58:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 格温 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Gwen…run…
Dialogue: 0,1:58:23.30,1:58:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 放她下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, Harry put her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.62,1:58:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 快停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, stop this right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.07,1:58:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是这样的人 哈利 放她下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you, Harry, this is not you. Harry, put her down!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.03,1:58:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哈利 - 哈利已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Harry! - Harry's dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.96,1:58:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈利 这是我们俩之间的事 你想打一架么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry, this is between you and me. You wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.34,1:58:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来打我吧 放她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight me, let her go!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.27,1:59:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.85,1:59:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到你了 我要把你放下来一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, I'm going to put you down right here.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:45.38,2:01:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.48,2:01:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.02,2:02:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.73,2:02:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.03,2:02:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,别离开我 别离开我 不要离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me, stay with me, stay with me, you stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:39.61,2:02:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.50,2:02:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.70,2:02:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温不要啊 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwen…no, please!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:52.78,2:02:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.02,2:03:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能没有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:05.90,2:05:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们单独谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.72,2:05:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有进展了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made progress?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.71,2:05:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了几个合适的候选人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I laid down and find several worthy candidates.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.98,2:05:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that Spider-Man's gone…
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.49,2:05:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这城市也将大不相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}the city will never be the same.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.12,2:05:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可就指着这个呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…I'm counting on that.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.53,2:05:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到进展 你看起来好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of progress, you're looking better.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.11,2:05:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,时好时坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes and goes.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.79,2:05:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me more.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.82,2:05:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想要招募多少人 - 尽量精简\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many men did you have in mind? - I want to keep it small.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.79,2:05:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要的一切都在Oscorp\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you need is already at Oscorp.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:44.11,2:05:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,准许进入 欢迎菲尔斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Access granted. Welcome, Mr. Fiers.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.16,2:05:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第一个志愿者是谁 - 阿列克谢·西斯艾维奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is our first volunteer? - Aleksei Sytsevich.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.01,2:05:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,无期徒刑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently serving a life sentence.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:54.54,2:05:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是最想加入我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is most eager to join us.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.10,2:05:59.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.36,2:06:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就从他开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with him.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.54,2:06:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄籍犯人阿列克谢·西斯艾维奇在不明团伙的帮助下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian gangster Aleksei Sytsevich was broken.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.90,2:06:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,从号称铜墙铁壁的监狱中\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of a classified penitentiary known simply as "The Vault"
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.93,2:06:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功潜逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}by an unknown team of men.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.84,2:06:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是继五个月前蜘蛛侠消失后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's yet another example of increased criminal activity.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.46,2:06:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯罪活动增加的另一个迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the disappearance of Spider-Man 5 months months ago.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.04,2:06:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠的消失在城市中心留下一个空洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}The webslingers absence has left a hole in the heart of the city.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.46,2:06:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论你们相信与否 就连\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe it or not even the New York City.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:22.49,2:06:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约警方也和纽约民众一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police Department has joined the chorus of New Yorkers.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.14,2:06:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始希望蜘蛛侠归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in hoping for the return of the webslinger.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.52,2:06:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界都在询问同一个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire world seems to be asking the same question:
Dialogue: 0,2:06:30.69,2:06:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:33.94,2:06:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有那蜘蛛侠真不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad without that spider-guy.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:38.23,2:06:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他消失了真糟糕 好像大家真的很需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad he disappeared, seems like everybody really needs him.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.92,2:06:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.42,2:06:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 彼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not sure. - Peter…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.54,2:06:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.02,2:07:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.54,2:07:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 真是有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? It's so funny…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.02,2:07:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直想把这儿收拾一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to clean up around here, get organised and.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.06,2:07:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把本的东西装箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}been putting some of Ben's stuff…in boxes.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.32,2:07:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的是箱子越沉 我就越轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's funny that the heavier the box gets, the lighter I feel.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.69,2:07:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把他的东西都扔掉么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You throwing his stuff away?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.98,2:07:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 怎么可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, God no.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:22.64,2:07:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会那样做 它们是我的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't do that. It's a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.62,2:07:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just…finding…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.52,2:07:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,为它们找个更好的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}a better place for it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:35.73,2:07:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看它们最后一眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take one last look…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.76,2:07:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后就把它们放回属于它们的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm gonna put it where it belongs.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.96,2:08:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在今天这样美丽的日子 人们容易感受到希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is easy to feel hopeful on a beautiful day like today.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:11.30,2:08:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但生活中也总有不如意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there will be dark days ahead of us too.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.12,2:08:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你感到孤独的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}There will be days when you feel all alone.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.34,2:08:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,更需要心怀希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's when hope is needed most.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.03,2:08:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管情况有多糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how bad it gets.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.96,2:08:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,前途有多迷茫 请向我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}or how lost you feel, you must promise me.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.30,2:08:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都会紧握希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you will hold on to hope.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.34,2:08:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,让其长存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:38.49,2:08:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须比苦难更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be greater than what we suffer.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.32,2:08:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的愿望就是 你们能与希望融为一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wish for you is to become hope.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:45.60,2:08:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们需要希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}People need that.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.44,2:08:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我们失败了又何妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even if we fail, what better way is there to live.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.23,2:08:55.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看周围吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}As we look around here today,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.66,2:08:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是这些朋友造就了现在的我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}that all of the people who help make us who we are,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.42,2:09:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这像是一番告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it feels like we're saying 'goodbye'
Dialogue: 0,2:09:03.53,2:09:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们都会把对方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we'll carry a piece of each other.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.31,2:09:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成自己的一部分继续生活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}into everything that we do next.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.75,2:09:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,时刻提醒自己 我们到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}to remind us of who we are.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:15.57,2:09:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真到了别离的时刻 我会说\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if we were meant to be,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.72,2:09:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我与你们度过了美好的四年 我会想念你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a great 4 years with you. I'll miss you all very much.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:46.45,2:09:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:01.36,2:10:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在位于帕克大道56街\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here live on Park Avenue 56th Street.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.91,2:10:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一片混乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}where it's complete chaos.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:05.70,2:10:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个在武装战甲中的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man in some sort of weaponised armored suit.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.10,2:10:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在市中心大搞破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}is wreaking havoc on midtown.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.75,2:10:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是犀牛人 我说过我一定会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Rhino. I told you I would be back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.44,2:10:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,豪尔赫 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jorge, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.72,2:10:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火 所有人 停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire. Everybody hold your fire.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.04,2:10:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩 你得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid, you got to get…
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.81,2:10:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看呐 纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, New York.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:53.82,2:10:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spider-Man is back.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.14,2:10:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my baby.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:02.50,2:11:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,真勇敢啊孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brave boy, huh.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.99,2:11:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我吓到你了么 小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Aleksei scares you, little boy?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:24.54,2:11:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛侠 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:36.43,2:11:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你会回来的 - 谢谢你为我站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew you'd come back. - Yeah, thanks for stepping up for me.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.66,2:11:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我见过的最勇敢的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the bravest kid I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:43.32,2:11:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来处理这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take care of this jerk,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:44.39,2:11:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去照顾你妈妈 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go take care of your mom…okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:46.08,2:11:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了快走吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright, get out of here, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:55.68,2:11:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要来打我了吗 现在就来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you fight me, will you fight me now?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.34,2:12:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,代表纽约所有的好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}On behalf of the fine people of New York city.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:02.52,2:12:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,和所有真正的犀牛们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and real rhinos everywhere…
Dialogue: 0,2:12:03.98,2:12:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你那机器小爪子举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you to turn your mechanised paws in the air!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:08.22,2:12:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我可以捏碎你 我可以毁掉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never! I can crush you! I can destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.51,2:12:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要让我下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have me come down.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:12.50,2:12:14.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后杀掉我吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- there so that you can kill me? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.45,2:12:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上就来 唉 还是家里好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right there. Ah…there's no place like home.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.97,2:14:50.31,Title,0,0,0,0,,《超凡蜘蛛侠2》
